Under Assumption \ref{ass:basic} and Assumption \ref{ass:tail}, the regret of the adaptive nearest neighbor method with UCB exploration is bounded by
	\begin{eqnarray}
		R\lesssim \left\{
		\begin{array}{ccc}
			T^{1-\min\left\{\frac{(\alpha+1)\beta}{\alpha+(d+2)\beta}, \beta\right\}}|\mathcal{A}|\ln T &\text{if} & \beta\neq \frac{1}{d+2}\\
			T^\frac{d+2}{d+1}|\mathcal{A}|\ln^2T &\text{if} & \beta = \frac{1}{d+2}.
		\end{array}
		\right.
		\label{eq:adatail}
	\end{eqnarray}
